[00:01.19]易考范文九
[00:04.48]In the picture, a man is applying paint to a table.
[00:10.60]He does it so carefully that every inch of the table is coated with paint,
[00:15.85]which symbolizes wealth according to the picture.
[00:19.36]The message conveyed in the picture is clear:
[00:22.42]we should carry out the policy that people in China reach the goal of common wealth,
[00:28.43]an indispensable premise for us to build a harmonious society.
[00:32.59]Thanks to the Reform and Opening-up policy,
[00:36.31]some people in China have removed their financial stress and led a comfortable life.
[00:42.21]But meanwhile, as China is a country with vast territory and a large population,
[00:47.94]there exist some isolated mountainous villages,
[00:51.56]where people cannot afford medical treatment, education, even daily necessities.
[00:57.79]When the coastal cities develop rapidly, these poverty-stricken regions remain backward.
[01:04.46]There's no denying that the widening gap between the rich and the poor
[01:09.82]as well as that between the urban and rural areas could jeopardize the social stability.
[01:15.73]In light of the grievousness of the issue,
[01:18.74]it is imperative for governments at all levels to take effective steps
[01:23.44]to reduce economic imbalances and bridge the widening gap.
